  "id": "equity-theory",
  "term": "equity theory",
  "definition": "Equity theory is the idea that people judge an exchange as fair when what each person puts in and gets out are in proportion. It treats perceived input–outcome balance as a main basis for deciding whether a situation is just or unjust.",
